hvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>  </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"II and III  only\".          </p>\n</div>",
